GAME DATA

Forza Horizon 2 and Forza Motorsport 5 are not part of this program. No file of either game, or
part of one, is distributed here. The server reads the files extracted from the operator's own
game install (tools/gamedata/build.py) at run time. The tables in gamedata/ are our own facts,
numbers and names (identifiers, limits, layouts and corrections we wrote or measured), not game
files.


